    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dream Crawler is a 2D, top-down roguelike RPG with a focus on combat and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run you'll be facing different enemies, different worlds, skills and weapons and lots and lots of secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move around, attack, interact. These are the three actions that you'll be doing again and again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and complex crafting system. Each objects can be upgraded in a lot of different ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passive skills allows you to change the gameplay in substantial ways: double damage of bows and crossbows, freeze enemy on every strike, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive combat: strike in any direction with either the mouse or the keyboard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find dream fragments. They are the key to returning back to the real world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dream Crawler is a 2D, top-down roguelike RPG with a focus on combat and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run you'll be facing different enemies, different worlds, skills and weapons and lots and lots of secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move around, attack, interact. These are the three actions that you'll be doing again and again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and complex crafting system. Each objects can be upgraded in a lot of different ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passive skills allows you to change the gameplay in substantial ways: double damage of bows and crossbows, freeze enemy on every strike, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive combat: strike in any direction with either the mouse or the keyboard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find dream fragments. They are the key to returning back to the real world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
